@startuml F5.6-D02-cadastrar-aluno
title F5.6-D02 — Cadastrar novo aluno
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "StudentController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar novo aluno
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /academico/alunos
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
note right of Ctrl
  senha temp em memória
  + Argon2id antes da TX
end note
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT user\n+ audit_log\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Sec: aluno na tabela

@enduml
